                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does a POS system cost to build?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: ₹22-50 lakh ($27K-60K). Growth: ₹60 lakh - 1.5 Cr ($72K-180K). Enterprise: ₹1.5-4 Cr ($180K-480K).</p>
                                        <h3>Should I build POS as a native app or web?</h3>
                                        <p>Native (or PWA with offline caching) — pure web POS fails in real retail because connectivity fails.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest failure mode for POS builds?</h3>
                                        <p>Under-investing in offline-first design. Retail can't stop when Wi-Fi goes down.</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need fiscal printers?</h3>
                                        <p>In some jurisdictions yes (Italy, Portugal, some Latin American countries). India, UAE, UK, USA, Australia typically don't require fiscal printers but do require compliant tax invoicing.</p>
